Z||000019||Oreif||03-25-2000||09:57 PM||||I thought the DOHC 3.4L used rubber belts for the cams and that this caused lots of problems (having to change them every 30K miles or pay to have heads reworked). I would go with the new Ram Air 3.4L. I too have heard too many horror stories about the dual cam 3.4L.||||reg||1
